 "also": "Also: 800 Manga109-s pages (hal-utokyo/Manga109-s, gated, revision 4b42924bb8afdb3460798fcfc9c09306b57e53fb, from Manga109s_released_2026_05_21.zip, random.Random(0)), labelled 'manga page' and 'comic'; the first 1,200 COCO items degraded in turn (low light, Gaussian blur, JPEG quality 4, motion blur), labelled 'synth:'; and synthetic images (neuron_lens.media_sets.synth_images, seed 0: gratings, colours, gradients, checkerboards, noise, shapes, glyphs, scripts in Noto fonts, code and maths). ImageNet is gated and its terms forbid redistribution, so the release links to its rows. CelebA is read without identities, and without its 'Attractive' attribute."
